{"title": "Dialogue", "pageid": 19154, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dialogue", "categories": ["Dialogue"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Talk_with_Talk.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/6/65/Talk_with_Talk.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Talk_with_Talk.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Dialogue</b> in <i>Baldur's Gate 3</i> occurs overhead when travelling and when interacting with certain characters. \n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Interacting with most characters opens a dialogue cutscene where the active party member can choose from a given set of questions, comments and responses. The game can be highly reactive to choices made during dialogue, in both short and long term repercussions. The speaker’s <a href=\"/wiki/Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class\">class</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Race\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Race\">race</a> often unlock new options, and additional choices can appear based on discoveries made in game<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>.\n</p><p>Occasionally a conversation option may include <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">ability checks</a> such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/25px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/38px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/50px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/25px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/30px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/40px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Strength\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png/20px-Strength_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Strength_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/20px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/30px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/40px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/20px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>. Sometimes the interacting party member may rely on skills, including <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/20px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/30px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/40px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intimidation\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png/20px-Intimidation_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e2/Intimidation_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">Intimidation</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/20px-History_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/30px-History_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/40px-History_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"History\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c5/History_Icon.png/20px-History_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c5/History_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/History\" title=\"History\">History</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/20px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/30px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/40px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Persuasion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png/20px-Persuasion_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f7/Persuasion_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a>. Certain spells can also be cast during dialogue, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guidance\" title=\"Guidance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/20px-Guidance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/30px-Guidance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/40px-Guidance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guidance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp/20px-Guidance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Guidance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guidance\" title=\"Guidance\">Guidance</a>. Other spells, like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Friends\" title=\"Friends\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Friends_Icon.webp/20px-Friends_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Friends_Icon.webp/30px-Friends_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Friends_Icon.webp/40px-Friends_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Friends\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Friends_Icon.webp/20px-Friends_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Friends_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Friends\" title=\"Friends\">Friends</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts\" title=\"Detect Thoughts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp/20px-Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp/40px-Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detect Thoughts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp/20px-Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Detect_Thoughts_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts\" title=\"Detect Thoughts\">Detect Thoughts</a> might be frowned upon if discovered, especially in Tactician and Honour <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty\" title=\"Difficulty\">mode</a>. Additionally, the spells <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Animals\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Speak_with_Animals_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Animals\" title=\"Speak with Animals\">Speak with Animals</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/30px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/40px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/20px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> are required for certain dialogues.\n</p><p>Recent dialogue history is shown in the journal menu as a transcript of conversations by order of the time they occurred.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Banter\">Banter</span></h2>\n<p>Banter describes overhead conversations between two or more companions outside of cutscenes. These conversations typically have fewer branches and variants than dialogue in cutscenes. \n</p><p>See below for pages detailing each companion's banter \n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/banter\" title=\"Astarion Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/70px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Astarion Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/70px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Astarion/banter\">Astarion Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale/banter\" title=\"Gale Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/70px-Gale_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gale Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/70px-Gale_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gale/banter\">Gale Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin/banter\" title=\"Halsin Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/70px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Halsin Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png/70px-Halsin_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Halsin_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Halsin/banter\">Halsin Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira/banter\" title=\"Jaheira Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png/70px-Jaheira_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Jaheira Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png/70px-Jaheira_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Jaheira_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Jaheira/banter\">Jaheira Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach/banter\" title=\"Karlach Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/70px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Karlach Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png/70px-Karlach_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/60/Karlach_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Karlach/banter\">Karlach Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel/banter\" title=\"Laezel Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/70px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Laezel Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png/70px-Lae%27zel_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Lae%27zel_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lae'zel/banter\">Laezel Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc/banter\" title=\"Minsc Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png/70px-Minsc_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Minsc Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png/70px-Minsc_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Minsc_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minsc/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Minsc/banter\">Minsc Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara/banter\" title=\"Minthara Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png/70px-Minthara_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Minthara Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png/70px-Minthara_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Minthara_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Minthara/banter\">Minthara Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart/banter\" title=\"Shadowheart Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/70px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png/70px-Shadowheart_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Shadowheart_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shadowheart/banter\">Shadowheart Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll/banter\" title=\"Wyll Banter\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/70px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wyll Banter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png/70px-Wyll_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Wyll_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll/banter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wyll/banter\">Wyll Banter</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Location_Remarks\">Location Remarks</span></h2>\n<p>Location Remarks are one line comments made by companions outside of cutscenes remarking on the world around the party at that moment.\n</p><p>See below for pages detailing each companion's location remarks\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/Location_Remarks\" title=\"Astarion Remarks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/70px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Astarion Remarks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png/70px-Astarion_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Astarion_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-text\" style=\"width: 70px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/Location_Remarks\" title=\"Astarion/Location Remarks\">Astarion Remarks</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-imagetext-image\" style=\"width: 70px; height: 100px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale/Location_Remarks\" title=\"Gale Remarks\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/70px-Gale_Approval.png.webp, /w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Gale Remarks\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png/70px-Gale_Approval.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Gale_Approval.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></d